OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners call on PM to scrap
OL,4,Afloating bus stops
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisability campaigners and
OL,7,Forganisations have called on the prime
OL,8,Fminister to ban and remove England's
OL,9,Ffloating bus stops due to concerns the
OL,10,Finfrastructure poses a major safety
OL,11,Fhazard for blind, deaf and disabled
OL,12,Fcommuters.
OL,14,FFloating bus stops - also known as bus
OL,15,Fstop bypasses - feature a dedicated
OL,16,Fcycle lane routed between the main
OL,17,Fpavement and the passenger waiting
OL,18,Fisland.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
