OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners call on PM to scrap
OL,4,Afloating bus stops
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile designed to protect cyclists from
OL,7,Fmain-road traffic, critics argue that
OL,8,Fthe layout creates a daily hazard for
OL,9,Fvulnerable pedestrians attempting to
OL,10,Fboard or leave buses.
OL,12,FThe government said it was listening
OL,13,Fcarefully to concerns raised by
OL,14,Fdisability groups and local
OL,15,Forganisations.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
